# Store text as LF in the repository and check it out as LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows makes Flutter's regenerated
# plugin files (linux/flutter/generated_plugins.cmake and friends) show up as
# modified after every `flutter pub get` or build, even though their content is
# identical. Declaring the rule here keeps `git status` honest.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never apply line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
